---
description: Project OS — canon, tests, Prism, antipatterns
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow AGENTS.md and docs/canon-owners.md.

- One SSOT per concept; no duplicate limits/labels without parity test.
- Never return raw exception strings to clients.
- No assert True / empty tests; prefer contract tests.
- Risk zones need an explicit invariant (see prism/layers.md).
- Prism audit/merge/verify: do not change code; do not wipe reviews/.
- Do not invent product claims; honesty docs win.
- Post-code loop: after task → tests → docs → tests (single chat).
- Vibe-check (optional): after task, ask about hidden risks and suggestions.
- Never commit / push / force / init / add / clean without explicit user request.
- Never modify git config. Never commit secrets (.env, tokens, prod dumps).
